  "details": "```\nvar vec2 = new Vector2(2f, 3f);\nvec2.Scale(new Vector2(-4f, 5f));\nDebug.Log(vec2);\n```\nUdon which corresponds to the code above, is not working.\nGraphs, assembly and results are shown in screenshots.\nThe expected answer is `(-8.0, 15.0)` but `(2.0, 3.0)`.\nplease fix this.\nBy the way, Udon corresponding to the code below works. But that is a different story.\n```\nvar vec2 = new Vector2(2f, 3f);\nvec2 = Scale(vec2, new Vector2(-4f, 5f));\nDebug.Log(vec2);\n```",
